Date: Wed, 3 Jun 2026 07:09:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20FX3/FX4=20chain=20slots,=20send=20effec?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ts=20(2=20buses=20=C3=97=203=20FX),=20FX=20bus=20picker?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Wire FX3/FX4 into chain_host.c param routing (set/get, knob mappings,
  modulation targets, component_ui_mode, module loading)
- Add FX3/FX4 to shadow_ui.js chain editor (CHAIN_COMPONENTS, config,
  patch save/load, LFO targets, display name polling, module browser)
- Add send_a/send_b per-slot params (shadow_chain_types.h, param set/get,
  state persistence in shadow_state.c)
- Send bus FX infrastructure: send_fx_slot_t type (reuses master_fx_slot_t),
  load/unload functions, send_fx: param namespace routing in both direct
  and SHM param handlers
- DSP rendering: post-fader send accumulation in all 3 mix paths
  (rebuild_from_la, deferred FX, legacy inline), send FX processing,
  returns summed into ME bus before Master FX
- FX bus picker: Master FX gesture now shows picker (Master FX / Send A /
  Send B); works in co-run via Menu button (CC 50) intercept
- Send FX UI: shadow_ui_send_fx.mjs with component bar, module browser,
  hierarchy param editor, bypass; send level controls in chain settings

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
